      "id": "79cabae3-625f-41c5-9e01-4d28c887e794",
      "body": "Let me verify one detail directly \u2014 the agent flagged a \"last offset must be 0\" convention that the current config's `[-60, -36]` doesn't obviously satisfy, so I want to check that myself before passing it on.",
      "time": 1789567071.5558856,
