      "body": "for the figures im plotting as a check, does this mean im grabbing the images from helio.py, not flare_dataset.py? how can i trust the images im looking at vs the timesteps that are included on the image? in the notebook im working on right now, im actually trying to figure out if its the right image frames that are being used at the inputs and output. tmp/surya_workshop/downstream_apps/flare_forecast/0_dataset_TEST-2.ipynb",
      "type": "msg",
