            "raw_output": "===== FIGURE 0  size=961x1214 =====\n COLUMN bands (x_start, x_end, width), thresh=2% height:\n    (11, 951, 941)\n ROW bands (y_start, y_end, height), thresh=2% width:\n    (9, 21, 13)\n    (45, 344, 300)\n    (352, 651, 300)\n    (719, 898, 180)\n    (1026, 1205, 180)\n===== FIGURE 1  size=987x1214 =====\n COLUMN bands (x_start, x_end, width), thresh=2% height:\n    (24, 964, 941)\n ROW bands (y_start, y_end, height), thresh=2% width:\n    (9, 21, 13)\n    (45, 344, 300)\n    (352, 651, 300)\n    (719, 898, 180)\n    (1026, 1205, 180)\nShell cwd was reset to /home/jovyan/tmp/surya_workshop/downstream_apps/flare_forecast/data",
